    {
      "type": "Block",
      "value": "---\nesid: sec-intl.locale.prototype.getWeekInfo\ndescription: >\n  When the locale has no region, the Add Likely Subtags algorithm is used to\n  derive the region whose week info is returned.\ninfo: |\n  RegionPreference ( locale )\n  ...\n  2. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n    a. Set _region_ to CanonicalUnicodeSubdivision(_locale_, *\"sd\"*).\n    b. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n      i. Let _maximal_ be the result of the Add Likely Subtags algorithm applied\n         to _locale_. If an error is signaled, set _maximal_ to _locale_.\n      ii. Set _maximal_ to CanonicalizeUnicodeLocaleId(_maximal_).\n      iii. Set _region_ to GetLocaleRegion(_maximal_).\n      iv. If _region_ is *undefined*, then\n        1. Set _region_ to *\"001\"*.\n  ...\nfeatures: [Intl.Locale, Intl.Locale-info]\n---",
      "start": 124,
      "end": 916
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " In order not to rely on a particular implementation's locale data, this test",
      "start": 918,
      "end": 997
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " searches for a suitable locale without a region subtag, but where the likely",
      "start": 998,
      "end": 1077
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": " region would influence the supported week info.",
      "start": 1078,
      "end": 1128
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
      "value": "",
      "start": 1129,
      "end": 1131
    },
    {
      "type": "Line",
